            "review_1_photo": "shopify://shop_images/rec4.webp",
            "review_1_name": "Clara D.",
            "review_1_rating": "5",
            "review_1_title": "",
            "review_1_text": "I have sensory issues and most bras make me want to crawl out of my skin. This fabric is butter. BUTTER. I’ve taken naps in this thing which sounds insane but it’s that comfortable. The straps are wide enough that they don’t dig into my shoulders even with bigger boobs. If you’re on the fence just buy it, I’m not being dramatic.",
            "review_2_photo": "shopify://shop_images/rec2.webp",
            "review_2_name": "Astrid N.",
            "review_2_rating": "5",
            "review_2_title": "",
            "review_2_text": "I buy a new bra every 3 months because the underwire always breaks or the elastic gives up. Bought this in September and it still looks brand new after washing it like 20 times. The shape hasn’t changed at all. Only “complaint”: now I own 4 of the same bra and my drawer looks ridiculous lol. Worth every penny honestly.",
            "review_3_photo": "shopify://shop_images/rec6.webp",
            "review_3_name": "Ingrid W.",
            "review_3_rating": "5",
            "review_3_title": "",
            "review_3_text": "4th cup, always had problems with bras either hurting or looking terrible. This is the first wireless bra that actually SUPPORTS. I keep checking in the mirror because I can’t believe there’s no underwire. The back smoothing is 👩‍🍳👌 — wore it under a fitted dress for a wedding and got compliments all night. Getting one for my sister too.",
            "review_4_photo": "shopify://shop_images/rec5.jpg",
            "review_4_name": "Émilie V.",
            "review_4_rating": "5",
            "review_4_title": "",
            "review_4_text": "Ok so I bought this because I was DONE with underwires stabbing me at 2pm every single day. Expected comfort, didn’t expect my boobs to look this good too lol 😂 The wide back part is no joke — zero rolls showing under my work shirts. Already ordered 2 more in different colors because I’m never going back to regular bras.",
            "review_5_photo": "shopify://shop_images/rec7.webp",
            "review_5_name": "Sophia K.",
            "review_5_rating": "5",
            "review_5_title": "",
            "review_5_text": "After breastfeeding two kids my boobs were... not what they used to be. I’ve tried every push-up bra and they all hurt after an hour. This thing? I wore it for a 10-hour shift and FORGOT I had it on. My husband goes “did you do something different?” Sir, I changed my bra 😩 The lift is natural, not fake looking. 10/10 would marry this bra."
          },
