        "custom_liquid_Tgzmyi": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"vr-faq-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-header\">\n    <span class=\"vr-faq-label\">FAQs</span>\n\n    <h2>HAVE QUESTIONS? WE'RE HERE TO HELP!</h2>\n\n    <p>\n      Need help? Write to us at\n      <a href=\"mailto:info@nicshape.com\">\n        info@nicshape.com\n      </a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-list\">\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What's special about this bra?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>It looks like a regular bra, but it’s completely different. Three innovations make it work:</p><p><strong>1. WaveBand™ W-Shaped Underband:</strong> No underwire. The W-shaped band sits under your breasts and supports them naturally from below. Real lift without the pain.</p><p><strong>2. Expanded Back Panel:</strong> 3x wider than standard bras. Smooths out back rolls, armpit bulges, and side fat. Your back looks flat and smooth under any top.</p><p><strong>3. Buttery-Soft Seamless Fabric:</strong> Invisible under clothes — even white shirts. Antibacterial, breathable, and doesn’t smell even after a full day.</p><p>Unlike regular bras, there’s no wire to break after 3 months.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will it tear easily?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>NO. It’s built to last.</p><p>You can pull it hard putting it on, machine wash it 200+ times, wear it every single day — and it won’t break.</p><p>We also have a LIFETIME GUARANTEE: if it breaks, we replace it for free. Forever.</p><p>Stop spending €30 every 3 months on bras where the underwire snaps.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Does it really support or is it just comfortable?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>YES to both. That’s the whole point.</p><p>The W-shaped underband gives you the same support as an underwire bra, minus the pain.</p><p>You get real lift and separation all day. Works for: office, gym, nights out, even sleeping (it’s that comfortable).</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will it show under clothes?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>NO. Completely invisible.</p><p>Seamless fabric with no edges or seams showing. Disappears under:</p><ul><li>White shirts</li><li>Fitted tops</li><li>Stretch dresses</li><li>Sheer blouses</li></ul><p>Also hides back rolls and armpit bulges thanks to the expanded back panel.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Does it really work for larger breasts?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>YES. Specifically designed for it. Here’s how:</p><ul><li>W-shaped underband distributes weight evenly across your chest</li><li>Wide straps reduce pressure on shoulders — no more red marks</li><li>Expanded back panel provides support without digging in</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Does it roll up during the day?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>NO. It stays put all day.</p><p>Why other bras roll up: too tight band, bad fabric, wrong design.</p><p>This one: the wide band grips naturally, the fabric is elastic but not compressive, and the design is tested for 12+ hours of movement.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>How do I wash it?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Machine wash or hand wash — both work.</p><p><strong>Washing:</strong> 30°C, delicate cycle. Regular detergent. NO bleach, NO fabric softener.</p><p><strong>Drying:</strong> Air dry flat or hanging. NEVER tumble dryer (it destroys the elastic).</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> Store flat or hanging. Don’t fold the underband area.</p><p>Tip: Get 2-3 and rotate weekly — they’ll last twice as long.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>When will my order arrive?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>SHIPPING:</p><p>Your order arrives in 5-7 days.</p><p>WITH EVERY ORDER:</p><p>Tracking number sent to your email so you always know where your package is. Our support team is here if you need anything.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What if I don't like it?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>No problem. You have 3 GUARANTEES:</p><p>1. Money-Back Guarantee (30 days) — Don’t like it? Full refund. No questions asked.</p><p>2. Free Size/Color Exchange — Wrong size? We swap it for free. You only cover return shipping.</p><p>3. Lifetime Replacement Guarantee — It breaks? We replace it. Free. Forever.</p><p>ZERO RISK. Either you love it, or you get your money back.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .vr-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 35px 30px 45px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-section *,\n  .vr-faq-section *::before,\n  .vr-faq-section *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* CABEÇALHO */\n\n  .vr-faq-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header h2 {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 40px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header p {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header a {\n    color: #333;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* LISTA DE PERGUNTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-list {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item {\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 57px;\n    padding: 16px 5px;\n    margin: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #383838;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: left;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    text-transform: none;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::marker {\n    content: '';\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::before,\n  .vr-faq-item summary::after {\n    content: none !important;\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid currentColor;\n    outline-offset: -2px;\n  }\n\n  /* SETAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: currentColor;\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    stroke-linecap: round;\n    stroke-linejoin: round;\n    transition: transform .2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item[open] summary svg {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n\n  /* RESPOSTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-answer {\n    padding: 0 5px 22px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: left;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer ul {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer li {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* MOBILE */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .vr-faq-section {\n      padding: 30px 15px 40px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header {\n      margin-bottom: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header h2 {\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header p {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-item summary {\n      min-height: 57px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 16px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-answer {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 0 4px 20px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n      transition: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
